ss": "Hacienda Mexican Grill, 797 N Redwood Rd, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.5, "num_of_reviews": 308, "price": null, "lat": 40.7863028, "lon": -111.9407972, "categories": "Mexican restaurant"}, {"gmap_id": "0x8752f4665df65c3d:0x635cdc0a3328935", "name": "Nico's Restaurant", "address": "Nico's Restaurant, 1458 North Temple, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.5, "num_of_reviews": 288, "price": "$", "lat": 40.771795999999995, "lon": -111.9329394, "categories": "Mexican restaurant"}, {"gmap_id": "0x8752f5aec2cda3ab:0x906ed4b1951efe3e", "name": "Sabor Latino", "address": "Sabor Latino, 2080 W North Temple, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.5, "num_of_reviews": 214, "price": null, "lat": 40.7718109, "lon": -111.9502782, "categories": "Latin American restaurant"}, {"gmap_id": "0x8752f5f914285419:0x630953ee7f5ae6b2", "name": "Los Tapatios", "address": "Los Tapatios, 120 900 W, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.5, "num_of_reviews": 188, "price": null, "lat": 40.771975399999995, "lon": -111.915711, "categories": "Restaurant"}, {"gmap_id": "0x8752f50075de0f25:0xca1e0cacee30c0d4", "name": "Tacos Hidalgo", "address": "Tacos Hidalgo, 400 W S Temple, Salt Lake City, UT 84103", "avg_rating": 4.5, "num_of_reviews": 98, "price": "$", "lat": 40.7694491, "lon": -111.9028772, "categories": "Taco restaurant"}]}

Action: run_sql({'query': "SELECT \n    e.name,\n    e.address,\n    e.avg_rating,\n    e.num_of_reviews,\n    r.rating,\n    r.text\nFROM review r\nJOIN establishments e ON r.gmap_id = e.gmap_id\nWHERE (e.address LIKE '%84116%' OR e.address LIKE '%Rose Park%' OR e.name LIKE '%Mestizo%' OR e.name LIKE '%Chubby%' OR e.name LIKE '%Red Iguana%')\n  AND (LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%breakfast%' OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%burrito%' OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%egg%' OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%savory%' OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%chilaquiles%')\nORDER BY e.avg_rating DESC, r.rating DESC\nLIMIT 20"})

Observation: {"row_count": 20, "truncated": false, "rows": [{"name": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park)", "address": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park), 1188-1198 600 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 58, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Everything is good here tacos,tortas and burritos. The truck is in the Smith's parking lot."}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "DELICIOUS! I got the hu tieu and the veggie meats and broth were yum and rich in flavor. Drumsticks are yummy (not on menu), but if you order it, you can have it! One order has two of them. All Chay eggless rolls are perfectly fried and tasty. They are oily though, of course, as they are fried. By the way chay means vegetarian in Vietnamese. Being Vietnamese and not eating meat anymore, it's a great to taste authentic and yummy Vietnamese food with a vegan twist. Recommended highly!!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "I was here for dinner last night. It appears family run business and very friendly staff.\nCounter service and sit wherever you like.\n\nI ordered Mongolian noodle salad(beef, noodle,egg rolls and salad) with  rice paper rolls aside. Meals came quick.\n\nFish sauce for the salad was really good. It made the meal very tasty.\n\nNothing fancy about it,but if you like eating. Recommend!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "They have the best vegan options I have found! Their eggrolls are a must when you go. We usually get the pho or the teriyaki \"chicken\" which is delicious. We drive up from Ogden just for their food. Never have had a bad experience!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Good location for delicious Vietnamese food. The food was so savory. Had a friend come into town and asked me to take him here again. Feels similar to a restaurant in New York I loved."}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "The full menu is vegan, but your non-veggie friends will never notice. I've vistited several times now and have yet to find anything on the menu that wasn't delicious. The environment is very peaceful and relaxing--a great place to dine alone or with friends."}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Love everything I\u2019ve gotten here! All vegan. My go-to\u2019s are the lemongrass fried rice and the pho. The veggie rolls are awesome too \ud83e\udd70"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "I had such a great dinner here tonight! I ordered the Golden Noodle and my gal ordered the Mongolian beef as a rice dish instead of noodle. Both dishes were very good. The egg rolls are seriously THE BEST I've ever had. The counter service was an added touch, being able to eat and not be interrupted so it gives some privacy which I love. There's a condiment and utensil station set up in the middle so you're able to get whatever you'd need. I'll definitely be returning!"}, {"name": "Wing Tips Bar + Bistro", "address": "Wing Tips Bar + Bistro, 5001 West, Wiley Post Way, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 8, "rating": 5.0, "text": "We got breakfast here and it was superb. Our server was so friendly and helpful. Such a nice guy!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Veggie House is hands-down the best vegan spot in SLC. They have amazing food, a super relaxed environment, and they're very helpful! I try to go at least once a week :)"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "My pho and egg rolls were fantastic!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Flavorful and filling from savory noodles and tasty rice dishes to delicious desserts even your non vegan/vegetarian friends will love it!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "This is a total hidden gem. They've got a lot of vegetarian options, but some meat dishes too so don't let that scare you away if veggie isn't your thing. We ordered spring rolls, BBQ noodle salad, and lemongrass fried rice, and it was all amazing."}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "I'm not a vegan. I don't know what right, spell, potion, or incantation one must recite to be one of those... Yet, this place does have vegan offerings. Folks who are in the know on vegan protocol will have to judge that.\n\nI'll stick with taste, quality, service, and price.\n\nIt was all great. When you do finally get here go ahead and meander up to the counter and order your goodies. No need to wait to be seated.\n\nI got the pho and it was great. My wife even liked it and she isn't a pho fiend like me.\n\nThere are some egg rolls on here I can't wait to get back and try. Nothing like the ones in the pic.\n\nOnce you've eaten your goodies please make sure you clean up after yourself. They have dish buckets by the water coolers in the center of the room. Dump your food and plan your next trip back."}, {"name": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park)", "address": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park), 1188-1198 600 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 58, "rating": 5.0, "text": "These guys know what they're doing. Found them from a pic someone posted to Reddit and I'm so glad I did. Burrito was huge, delicious and reasonably priced. Definitely coming back for the nachos next time"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Fills the body and soul.  Vegetarian greatness in pho, bahn mi, egg rolls, and more.  New Year's Day recovery meal could not have been better!"}, {"name": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park)", "address": "El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park), 1188-1198 600 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 58, "rating": 5.0, "text": "This place is BOMB! Y\u2019all I love cetos aka betos and never thought no burritos or tacos could beat it. But I was wrong this food truck knows E X A C T L Y what they\u2019re doing. Just go and try it!!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Food here is amazing and super cheap <3 got a Bahmi sandwich, the ocean lovers noodles and egg rolls. Every thing was cooked to perfection and the staff is so friendly. Wish I lived around here cause I\u2019d go here all the time. Al Chay for the win \ud83e\udd18"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "Food is great. I want to congratulate this place for having the most kind and friendly man at the cashier (might be the owner). He will always greet you with a big smile and help you as much as he can. This is a comfort pho, and other Vietnamese-Asian dishes. I believe everything here in Vegan. I would love to see more veggies and noodles in the pho, but other than that the flavor is amazing!"}, {"name": "All Chay", "address": "All Chay, 1264 W 500 N, Salt Lake City, UT 84116", "avg_rating": 4.8, "num_of_reviews": 762, "rating": 5.0, "text": "I can't believe this place isn't more packed than it is every time I go. Honestly, I'm glad Rose Park is the location for this establishment. Besides all the fast food and cheap Mexican on this part of town I am glad there's a delicious alternative.\n\nI recommend the Ocean Love Noodles! It's my go to meal every time I go. It has breaded \"shrimp\" and lots and lots of veggies over noodles.\n\nThe owners are (brother & sister) and they are wonderful people."}]}

